### ════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  USERS TESTS
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════

### TEST 1 — Get all users
### Expected: 200 OK with list
GET http://localhost:5030/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### TEST 2 — Get my own profile
### Expected: 200 OK with stats
GET http://localhost:5030/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### TEST 3 — Create a new artist user
### Expected: 201 Created
# @name createUser
POST http://localhost:5030/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Ananya Artist",
  "email": "ananya@polytrack.com",
  "password": "Artist@12345",
  "role": "artist",
  "timezone": "Asia/Kolkata"
}

###

### TEST 4 — Update own profile
### Expected: 200 OK
PUT http://localhost:5030/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Admin User Updated",
  "timezone": "Asia/Kolkata"
}

###

### TEST 5 — Change password
### Expected: 200 OK
POST http://localhost:5030/api/users/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "currentPassword": "Admin@123456",
  "newPassword": "Admin@123456"
}

###

### TEST 6 — Update user role
### Expected: 200 OK
PATCH http://localhost:5030/api/users/{{userId}}/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "role": "admin"
}

###

### TEST 7 — Get team workload
### Expected: 200 OK with per-artist stats
GET http://localhost:5030/api/users/workload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### TEST 8 — Get workload filtered by project
### Expected: 200 OK with project team only
GET http://localhost:5030/api/users/workload?projectId={{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### TEST 9 — Get notifications
### Expected: 200 OK
GET http://localhost:5030/api/users/{{userId}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### TEST 10 — Mark all notifications read
### Expected: 200 OK
POST http://localhost:5030/api/users/{{userId}}/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

