### TEST 11 — Dashboard stats
### Expected: 200 OK with all counts
GET http://localhost:5030/api/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### TEST 12 — Activity feed
### Expected: 200 OK with recent activity
GET http://localhost:5030/api/dashboard/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### TEST 13 — Activity feed filtered by project
GET http://localhost:5030/api/dashboard/activity?projectId={{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### TEST 14 — Projects progress
### Expected: 200 OK with active projects + completion %
GET http://localhost:5030/api/dashboard/projects-progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### TEST 15 — Upcoming deadlines (next 7 days)
### Expected: 200 OK with tasks + milestones
GET http://localhost:5030/api/dashboard/upcoming-deadlines?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### TEST 16 — Recent assets
### Expected: 200 OK with last 8 assets
GET http://localhost:5030/api/dashboard/recent-assets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### TEST 17 — Timesheet grid (this week)
### Expected: 200 OK with daily hours grid
GET http://localhost:5030/api/dashboard/timesheets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### TEST 18 — Timesheet for specific user
GET http://localhost:5030/api/dashboard/timesheets?userId={{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

